Manifest-Version: 1.0
AutoUpdate-Show-In-Client: false
OpenIDE-Module: org.netbeans.modules.phpforge.icons
OpenIDE-Module-Name: PHPForge Icon Theme
OpenIDE-Module-Short-Description: Flat PHP icon set in the JetBrains style for PHPForge IDE.
OpenIDE-Module-Long-Description: Injects flat, JetBrains-style icons for PHP types \
    (class, interface, trait, enum, function, constant, methods and fields) into the \
    php.editor module via branding locale JARs. Includes HiDPI @2x variants.
OpenIDE-Module-Specification-Version: 1.0
OpenIDE-Module-Display-Category: PHPForge IDE
